{"unit_id":"zp-home__dsh-recommend#card-zh","repo":"zp-home/dsh-recommend","commit":"d05006651fe3ab3ae94b68f0998998e9b4908b16","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-recommend 是面向 DSH Web 的插件发现与管理插件。它通过 host 工具和设置页排行标签接入 DSH，读取本地 registry、history 与 trends 快照。用户可以按综合分、星数或更新时间查看和筛选插件，按名称、描述及分类搜索，也能用目标描述与中英同义词推荐候选插件；趋势工具提供增长、排名、下载、新上榜与精选认证榜单。设置页还支持刷新数据、检查已安装插件、一键安装以及检查和更新 profile 依赖。数据快照从公开仓库下载并缓存到 DSH home；更新检查会查询 GitHub 和 npm。无需额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:63-397","src/host/web.ts:195-471","src/client/index.ts:144-151","cordis.patch.yml:1-27"]}
{"unit_id":"zp-home__dsh-recommend#card-en","repo":"zp-home/dsh-recommend","commit":"d05006651fe3ab3ae94b68f0998998e9b4908b16","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-recommend helps DSH Web users discover plugins. Host tools search, rank, recommend, and show trends; a settings tab displays rankings, refreshes data, checks installed plugins, and installs selections. It also checks and updates profile dependencies. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/index.ts:63-397","src/host/web.ts:195-471","src/client/index.ts:144-151","cordis.patch.yml:1-27"]}
